{"id":"vod_bf_27935","vodId":"27935","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"驱魔少年","name_cn":"驱魔少年","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-29/8177c6a2565b35a8ba684bf211490ba0.jpg"},"summary":"这是有关驱魔师和恶魔之间的故事。传说中，在很久以前，千年伯爵企图要占领地球，但最终被人类消灭。但预言师说，千年伯爵还会再度袭来。而现在，他来了。他欺骗那些因伤心而迷惘的人们，告诉他们复活心爱之人的办法。但这造出的其实是“恶魔”。而恶魔是千年伯爵妄想统治地球的武器。为了对付千年伯爵和这些恶魔，驱魔师们踏上了消灭恶魔的道路。他们各有各的厉害之处，亚连•沃克（小林沙苗 配音）便是其中一员。亚连和他的朋友们，包括神田优（樱井孝宏 配音）、李娜丽（伊藤静 配音）等开始了和千年伯爵的战斗。　　本剧改编自漫画家星野桂连载于《少年JUMP》上的同名漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 11:37:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":103,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qumoshaonian/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf